{"ts":1780405084813,"state_hash":"d55dc1f30599b390","passage":"Start","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Late Shifts\n\nMaya, 22, moves back to her hometown after dropping out of grad school. She takes the night shift at Mel's, a 24-hour diner two blocks from her brother's apartment. The diner owner notices everything. The cook on her shift barely speaks. The head waitress teaches her the floor. Her older brother is quietly there when she comes home at dawn. The neighbor in 2B has thin walls and a long memory.\n\nWe're a small indie studio crafting intimate, story-driven experiences. Every game is made with care, and your support helps us keep creating. If you enjoy our work, consider supporting us!\n\n👉 Support us on Patreon\n\n⚠️ This game contains adult content intended for players 18 years of age or older.\n\n✓ I am 18 or older - Enter Game\n✗ I am NOT 18 or older\n\nDeveloped by NutGames\n\n👉 Support us on Patreon","body_html":"<div class=\"game-intro\"> <h1>Late Shifts</h1> <p class=\"game-description\">Maya, 22, moves back to her hometown after dropping out of grad school. She takes the night shift at Mel's, a 24-hour diner two blocks from her brother's apartment. The diner owner notices everything. The cook on her shift barely speaks. The head waitress teaches her the floor. Her older brother is quietly there when she comes home at dawn. The neighbor in 2B has thin walls and a long memory.</p> <div class=\"developer-intro\"> <p class=\"developer-about\">We're a small indie studio crafting intimate, story-driven experiences. Every game is made with care, and your support helps us keep creating. If you enjoy our work, consider supporting us!</p> <p class=\"support-link\">👉 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/nutgames844\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"link-external\" tabindex=\"-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Support us on Patreon</a></p> </div> <div class=\"age-gate\"> <p class=\"age-warning\">⚠️ This game contains adult content intended for players 18