{"ts":1780405222576,"state_hash":"4ebf1cad4e6dee00","passage":"Canvas_cole_apartment_hub_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Cole's apartment (cole_apartment_hub) | Node: Cole's apartment\n\n\n\nHis studio, the drawings still going up faster than the wall has room for. He's at the little table with a pencil when she comes in, and he sets it down. His eyes go over her curvy frame once, unhurried, the way they always do.\n\nJamie: Nadia. Didn't think you'd come by.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTalk.\nStay the night.\nHead home.\n","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Cole's apartment <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(cole_apartment_hub)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Cole's apartment</div><br><p>His studio, the drawings still going up faster than the wall has room for. He's at the little table with a pencil when she comes in, and he sets it down. His eyes go over her curvy frame once, unhurried, the way they always do.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Jamie:</strong> Nadia. Didn't think you'd come by.</div></div><br><br><br><br><br><br><br> <span class=\"unlocked-choice\"> <a data-passage=\"Location_The_Apartment_Across_Town\" class=\"link-internal macro-link\" tabindex=\"0\">Talk.</a><br> </span>  <a data-passage=\"Canvas_cole_apartment_hub_Node_2\" class=\"link-internal macro-link\" tabindex=\"0\">Stay the night.</a><br> <a data-passage=\"Location_Main_Street\" class=\"link-internal macro-link\" tabindex=\"0\">Head home.</a><br>","modal_text":null,"variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"Canvas_cole_apartment_hub_Node_1","player":{"name":"Nadia","portrait":"maya.jpg","current_location":"","core_traits":{"corruption":0,"arousal":0,"energy":100,"hygiene":